  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fbetterdogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c93b172f-e281-4d3c-823a-400a3f2c4287.png\" width=\"781\" height=\"130\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sqzvDFF.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"255\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本页面也提供独立版本（请向下滚动）</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使用前请阅读<br>此资源包适用于 Minecraft 1.21.4 及以下版本，最低支持至 1.8.9 版本。<br></strong>运行此资源包需要&nbsp;<strong>Optifine</strong>（Forge版）或 <strong>EMF + ETF</strong>（Forge/Fabric版）或 <strong>CEM + Puzzle</strong>（Fabric版）。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示：对于 EMF + ETF 和 CEM + Puzzle</strong>，请参阅下方折叠内容中列出的所需模组。</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>注意 1：在 Fabric 上使用此资源包会导致部分狗模型出现一些极轻微的故障。</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><br>注意 2：部分基础功能存在轻微故障，但可通过以下方法修复：<br>驯服狼或给已驯服的狼佩戴支持的命名牌后，按 <strong>F3 + T</strong> 即可在游戏中显示对应的狗品种。</em>&nbsp;<strong><br></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">___</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使 Better Dog 资源包与 Fabric/Sodium 兼容所需的模组如下。所有模组均需放入 minecraft 的 mods 文件夹中。</strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">⚠️</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>重要提示<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">：</span></strong>请确保所有模组均与您使用的 Fabric 版本匹配。</span></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Fabric（CEM + Puzzle (Fabric) 必需）</strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252finstaller%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://fabricmc.net/use/installer/</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><strong>所需模组（EMF + ETF&nbsp;</strong>（Forge/Fabric版）<strong>）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Minecraft 版本 1.20.1 - 1.19.3）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Entity Model Features</span></strong></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API<br><br></strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>所需模组</strong><strong>（CEM + Puzzle</strong>&nbsp;(Fabric)<strong>）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Minecraft 版本 1.19.2 及以下）：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>重要提示！</strong>Minecraft 1.19.2 及以下版本所需的模组需进行以下配置设置：&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fF8e45wQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/a/F8e45wQ</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/custom-entity-models-cem/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Custom Entity Models (CEM)</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Cloth Config API</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/completeconfig/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>CompleteConfig</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-texture-features-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Entity Texture Features</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzle/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Puzzle</strong></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><strong>可选模组（非必需，但强烈建议安装以提升帧率）：</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Lithium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/phosphor/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Phosphor</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium/files\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Sodium</strong></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;（如遇问题，请阅读下方说明）&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kOcFo9u.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"1301\"><br>全品种游戏内截图：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>&nbsp;</strong><strong><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YpK30pq.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"130\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yfiBnIR.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"648\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>教程 - 添加自定义命名牌：<br></strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>在本简短教程中，我们将为金毛寻回犬添加自定义命名牌：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>1) </strong>打开 Minecraft 资源包文件夹。（%appdata% &gt; .minecraft &gt; resourcepacks）<br><br><strong>2) </strong>打开您正在使用的 Better Dogs 资源包版本。<br><br><strong>3) </strong>定位到 assets/minecraft/Optifine/mob/wolf。<br><br><strong>4) </strong>使用 Notepad++ 或类似的文本编辑工具打开&nbsp;<em>wolf_tame.properties&nbsp;</em>文件。<br><br><strong>5) </strong>按 Ctrl + F 并输入您想添加自定义命名的品种名称（本例中使用 <strong><em>金毛寻回犬</em></strong>）<br><br><strong>6) </strong>文件将跳转至以下行：<br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1<br><br></em><strong>7)</strong>&nbsp;以下行显示了当前支持的命名牌：<br><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden).*</em><br><br><strong>8) </strong>我们要添加的自定义名称为：Mike wazowski。我们将使用 \"&nbsp;<strong>| \"</strong>&nbsp;符号将此自定义名称与其他名称分隔开：<br><br><em>skins.26=11 12</em><br><em>name.26=iregex:.*(golden retriever|golden|Mike wazowski).*</em><br><em>weights.26=1 1</em><br><strong><br>9) </strong>覆盖当前的&nbsp;<em>wolf_tame.properties </em>文件。现在系统将支持自定义名称&nbsp;<em>Mike wazowski&nbsp;</em>。<br>（如果在修改这些文件时已处于游戏中，请按 F3 + T 刷新已激活的资源包）。<br><br><strong>注意：<br>- </strong>本教程适用于所有品种，不仅限于金毛寻回犬。<br>- 除非其他人也执行相同的步骤并添加相同的名称，否则其他使用此资源包的人在使用自定义添加的命名牌时将无法看到与您相同的品种。<br><br></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">独立版本<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dGHLWnb.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>这些独立版本对您的帧率影响更小<br>（点击下载按钮进行下载）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-wolves/download/3694826/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dX1qDDo.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3511701\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oZqR1DL.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3514180\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BL2vsG7.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3528488\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RJ0IpsX.png\" alt=\"巴哥犬\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3550731\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DfJy58p.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3738097\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9jI6XTt.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3916688\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83jqNGr.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3516155\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cO3jR0v.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3648293\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jDzUPmk.png\" width=\"142\" height=\"197\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ayukpXn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/download/3550731/file\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZpM1xYP.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"><strong>（点击下载按钮进行下载）</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-cats-curseforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xe1adNG.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-farm-animals\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aHEmv8l.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs/files/3536286\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/c7KHrHw.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/pet-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I9AzCyY.png\" width=\"143\" height=\"198\"></a></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jPEH6of.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"77\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JWbz8eY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong>（仅限 Optifine）<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NDszZji.gif\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3ajCdNW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eOcnVCF.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"675\"></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DsCy47K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"55\"></strong></p>\n<p>分步教程：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fa%252fVmO4MHx\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><strong>已知不兼容模组列表：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Xaero's Minimap（小地图）：</strong>会导致狗/狼的头部悬浮。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容资源包的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Revamped Wolf（重制狼）：</strong>会导致模型显示为线条状。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容资源包的替代方案：暂无。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Doggy Talents（狗狗天赋）：</strong>会导致模型显示为线条状。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>兼容资源包的替代方案：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-dogs-x-doggy-talents-next</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><strong>致谢</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\">感谢&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252ffrancielly%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Francy_Chan</a> 制作了本资源包<strong><em>Better Dogs V1.2（带项圈）</em></strong>版本中的项圈，并协助我解决命名牌相关问题。</li>\n<li>感谢 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/egoist1372/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">EGOIST1372</a> 协助我解决此资源包与 Sodium-Fabric 的兼容性问题。</li>\n<li>本页面使用的自定义字体由 codeman38 制作。</li>\n<li>本资源包特殊版本中使用的音效由 Hot Ideas Inc. 和 Zapsplat 制作。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>未经许可，请勿在任何地方上传此资源包。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>在 YouTube 视频中使用本资源包时，请在视频描述中添加此资源包的链接。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">这是我出于爱好制作的项目，但如果您愿意捐赠，我将不胜感激！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmrblueyetimc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1192828/description_cd73d6ea-5748-4aa7-9037-23e12d5be3c4.webp\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>当前及往期 Patreon 支持者名单</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">衷心感谢所有这些朋友的支持！</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Heyhay13 - 鸡肉档</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Nqobie - 鸡肉档</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Rinzler - 鸡肉档</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><strong>以及另外八位慷慨的匿名赞助者</strong></strong></li>\n</ul>\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iFbDq72.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></strong></strong></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/a/WszQzsB\" alt=\"\" width=\"Infinity\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/MdEY9Xj\" alt=\"\"></p>",
